WEBVTT

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:16.176
Laura, don't go too far away.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.760
Do you really think you
can get some time off?

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:30.764
No problem. I'll catch up with
you the day after tomorrow.

00:00:30.764 --> 00:00:33.232
Wait there for me, Laura.

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:50.577
Laura! Martina!

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:12.939
In my younger days, I lost

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:18.812
even the reason for this pain

00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:24.517
Crouching over, making excuses

00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:27.748
I must have...

00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:35.462
Taking hold of the premonition
I saw at the end of the blue,

00:01:35.462 --> 00:01:43.036
riding the wind, I'm off
to where the light shines

00:01:43.036 --> 00:01:45.872
I'll always be with you

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:48.375
see the sky in front of you

00:01:48.375 --> 00:01:52.778
fly high in a light from the deepest blue

00:01:54.547 --> 00:02:00.120
Riding the echo of swirling stars,

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:02.789
I sing out

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:11.458
May my voice reach you

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:32.481
Ai...

00:02:34.421 --> 00:02:38.491
I'm the one who collided with the shuttle.

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:42.222
I'm the one who killed your family, Jin!

00:02:51.704 --> 00:02:54.264
T-That can't be right...

00:02:56.443 --> 00:02:58.570
How can that be?

00:03:03.049 --> 00:03:04.880
What's that?!

00:03:07.554 --> 00:03:08.788
Gio!

00:03:08.788 --> 00:03:11.057
Hide-and-seek time is over.

00:03:11.057 --> 00:03:13.116
Captain Raina...

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:19.532
Don't try anything.

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:21.901
This isn't just about you.

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:23.703
Don't hurt Jin!

00:03:23.703 --> 00:03:27.140
That was my condition for
surrendering myself to you!

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:31.377
Surrender? You weren't caught?!

00:03:31.377 --> 00:03:34.247
There's something that I have to do.

00:03:34.247 --> 00:03:38.251
So for now, just do as they say.

00:03:38.251 --> 00:03:39.912
Toa...

00:03:47.127 --> 00:03:49.996
Now then, would you care to explain?

00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:53.333
Why did you take the Album out?

00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:55.602
Well...

00:03:55.602 --> 00:03:56.503
It was something l...

00:03:56.503 --> 00:03:58.805
I-It was a tactic!

00:03:58.805 --> 00:04:00.473
Tactic?

00:04:00.473 --> 00:04:04.310
A special order from
Commander Sakaki, to use the Album

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:09.616
as a lure, and capture the fugitive
Kamishina Jin, as well as Gio.

00:04:09.616 --> 00:04:11.518
A special order from Commander Sakaki?

00:04:11.518 --> 00:04:15.181
Y-You hadn't heard about it?

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:21.528
All right. In that case, there
is no problem. You may go.

00:04:21.528 --> 00:04:23.860
Then, if you'll excuse us...

00:04:38.945 --> 00:04:41.209
Releasing security lock.

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:49.989
This is the data that you want,
concerning the Resonance formula.

00:04:49.989 --> 00:04:53.393
Now, please back off of Gio.

00:04:53.393 --> 00:04:56.896
This is a consolation prize, is it?

00:04:56.896 --> 00:04:58.557
Very well.

00:04:59.899 --> 00:05:02.697
Assuming the data is genuine.

00:05:05.205 --> 00:05:08.174
W-What's this?

00:05:08.174 --> 00:05:10.699
Now you've done it, haven't you?

00:05:44.677 --> 00:05:48.581
We have the Album, Gio,
and Kamishina Jin with us,

00:05:48.581 --> 00:05:53.019
and departed without
incident at 20:30 Moon time.

00:05:53.019 --> 00:05:54.354
Good work.

00:05:54.354 --> 00:05:58.191
Tachibana Kazuki and Widow
are returning with us, as well.

00:05:58.191 --> 00:05:59.759
I see.

00:05:59.759 --> 00:06:02.195
Following your special order,
Commander Sakaki,

00:06:02.195 --> 00:06:07.700
their superb efforts contributed in
capturing the Album and the others.

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:10.536
My special order?

00:06:10.536 --> 00:06:12.739
Is that what Tachibana Kazuki told you?

00:06:12.739 --> 00:06:16.971
Yes. I did not hear
anything about it, though.

00:06:18.711 --> 00:06:21.475
They were indeed my instructions.

00:06:23.383 --> 00:06:29.756
I meant to tell you, as well,
but failed to do so. Sorry.

00:06:29.756 --> 00:06:33.993
Not at all. In that case, there is no problem.

00:06:33.993 --> 00:06:36.729
Our estimated time of arrival
on Earth is eight hours from now.

00:06:36.729 --> 00:06:39.960
I will give you a detailed
report upon our arrival.

00:06:42.235 --> 00:06:44.567
That is all. Over and out.

00:06:48.608 --> 00:06:50.743
- Saki-kun...
- Yes?

00:06:50.743 --> 00:06:54.280
Please put up Tachibana
Kazuki's personal data.

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:56.009
Acknowledged.

00:06:58.151 --> 00:06:59.652
Ah, Senpai...

00:06:59.652 --> 00:07:04.290
I'm leaving for the day. You're in charge.

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:06.292
Do you have a date?

00:07:06.292 --> 00:07:08.795
Hmm...

00:07:08.795 --> 00:07:10.363
That's a nice perfume.

00:07:10.363 --> 00:07:14.167
T-Thanks. Well, off I go...

00:07:14.167 --> 00:07:15.998
Nice work today.

00:07:24.544 --> 00:07:27.012
To the future of D Project.

00:07:30.817 --> 00:07:33.052
Delicious.

00:07:33.052 --> 00:07:35.021
You seem to be in a good mood.

00:07:35.021 --> 00:07:37.223
Aren't you happy, Professor?

00:07:37.223 --> 00:07:38.491
Happy?

00:07:38.491 --> 00:07:43.162
We've finally gotten our hands
on the Album... a live sample.

00:07:43.162 --> 00:07:45.331
Yes, that's right.

00:07:45.331 --> 00:07:50.136
Precious research material for you, huh?

00:07:50.136 --> 00:07:52.538
This is the moment the world
has been hoping for,

00:07:52.538 --> 00:07:55.641
for the sake of Earth's future.

00:07:55.641 --> 00:08:00.012
Not the world, but you, right?

00:08:00.012 --> 00:08:04.150
Sorry, seeing how giddy you are,
I couldn't help myself.

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:08.488
Anyhow, Professor, you must
realize that being able to analyze

00:08:08.488 --> 00:08:13.983
the biology of a live Original Dragon
is hugely significant for D Project!

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:20.922
Hugely significant, huh?

00:08:26.739 --> 00:08:28.875
Nothing but stars all around...

00:08:28.875 --> 00:08:30.610
Take this seriously.

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:32.339
Okay, okay.

00:08:35.681 --> 00:08:38.885
- What was that?!
- Multiple heat sources at six o'clock!

00:08:38.885 --> 00:08:40.614
Is that?

00:08:42.422 --> 00:08:45.858
- The Girouard Force?
- What do they think they're doing?

00:08:46.926 --> 00:08:52.131
Did you think you could get the jump
on me by feeding me false data?

00:08:52.131 --> 00:08:54.622
Don't you mock me, boy.

00:08:58.704 --> 00:09:00.899
- Here they come again!
- Evade!

00:09:03.543 --> 00:09:07.079
Damn, now they've done it!
Let's go, Machina!

00:09:07.079 --> 00:09:10.116
Hold it! I'm getting
confirmation from headquarters.

00:09:10.116 --> 00:09:14.420
Do not take any action against
them until we know the situation.

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:19.058
Sure enough, she's not going
to let us off that easily.

00:09:19.058 --> 00:09:21.994
No way! Why is the
Girouard Force attacking?!

00:09:21.994 --> 00:09:24.664
It's no use! I can't contact
the Girouard Force!

00:09:24.664 --> 00:09:28.100
Commander, we're receiving
a transmission from ISDA HQ!

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:31.437
S-Sasaki! What the hell is happening?!

00:09:31.437 --> 00:09:35.965
Attack at once! I mean,
report the situation.

00:09:40.746 --> 00:09:42.475
Nasty!

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:46.775
Amadeus! The shuttle!

00:09:50.456 --> 00:09:52.492
Sigelinde!

00:09:52.492 --> 00:09:54.026
Amadeus has been hit!

00:09:54.026 --> 00:09:55.695
They'll all be wiped out at this rate!

00:09:55.695 --> 00:09:57.964
- D-Don't attack them!
- Girouard Force Headquarters,
please come in! This is ISDA!

00:09:57.964 --> 00:10:00.466
- I'm contacting the government now!
- Girouard Force Headquarters,
please come in! This is ISDA!

00:10:00.466 --> 00:10:02.268
Permission to attack!

00:10:02.268 --> 00:10:05.104
S-Sakaki!

00:10:05.104 --> 00:10:08.307
Lindworm Unit, commence attack!

00:10:08.307 --> 00:10:09.509
Roger.

00:10:09.509 --> 00:10:11.704
Let's go, Howling Star.

00:10:14.814 --> 00:10:18.181
I've been waiting for this!
Let's go, Machina!

00:10:25.024 --> 00:10:27.151
Are you okay, Amadeus?

00:10:37.837 --> 00:10:39.634
Howling Star!

00:10:43.376 --> 00:10:45.037
Machina!

00:10:52.885 --> 00:10:54.546
Amadeus!

00:11:00.726 --> 00:11:03.593
Heh, you're not getting away!

00:11:15.408 --> 00:11:17.677
That's strange.

00:11:17.677 --> 00:11:19.668
They didn't fight back very hard.

00:11:21.447 --> 00:11:24.417
It's an enemy diversion!

00:11:24.417 --> 00:11:26.715
We're too far away from the shuttle!

00:11:28.287 --> 00:11:30.847
We can't get near the shuttle like that.

00:12:11.664 --> 00:12:13.291
Toa!

00:12:23.476 --> 00:12:26.741
Let's go, Jin! We have to protect Toa!

00:12:32.818 --> 00:12:34.654
Break through, no matter what!

00:12:34.654 --> 00:12:36.455
There are just too many of them.

00:12:36.455 --> 00:12:39.659
What's more, it'd be one thing
if they were just in front of us...

00:12:39.659 --> 00:12:41.286
Machina!

00:12:47.133 --> 00:12:50.369
Prepare to fire main cannon.

00:12:50.369 --> 00:12:54.273
But, unmanned though they may be,
our fighters are surrounding them.

00:12:54.273 --> 00:12:55.865
I don't care.

00:13:01.714 --> 00:13:03.545
Fire!

00:13:27.239 --> 00:13:29.375
How do you do, Raina-sama?

00:13:29.375 --> 00:13:31.138
Is that you?

00:13:32.511 --> 00:13:35.480
I-It's Otohime!

00:13:36.582 --> 00:13:39.016
Captain of the Vritra Unit.

00:13:41.153 --> 00:13:43.553
Habaragi ltsuki...

00:13:45.257 --> 00:13:50.429
It has been quite a long time,
Raina Cromwell-sama.

00:13:50.429 --> 00:13:53.489
I didn't want to meet you
again as inelegantly as this.

00:14:00.372 --> 00:14:03.864
We do not even have time
to exchange greetings, do we?

00:14:07.947 --> 00:14:09.608
So it would seem.

00:14:19.859 --> 00:14:22.128
That boy has the devil's own luck.

00:14:22.128 --> 00:14:23.529
How are the Agathions coming?

00:14:23.529 --> 00:14:24.296
Ma'am,

00:14:24.296 --> 00:14:26.924
they will reach the
cargo room momentarily.

00:14:29.468 --> 00:14:33.873
The enemy is here. Toa is in danger!

00:14:33.873 --> 00:14:35.307
Toa...

00:14:35.307 --> 00:14:40.446
Gio... Toa... killed my family...

00:14:40.446 --> 00:14:42.437
Snap out of it!

00:14:45.151 --> 00:14:50.222
It's like you said, you will protect Toa!

00:14:50.222 --> 00:14:52.452
Now is the time, isn't it?!

00:15:02.635 --> 00:15:04.262
Ai...

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:13.237
Toa...

00:15:15.114 --> 00:15:16.741
Who are you?

00:15:19.351 --> 00:15:21.787
I'm Toa.

00:15:21.787 --> 00:15:23.345
Toa...

00:16:11.403 --> 00:16:13.205
Let's go, Gio!

00:16:13.205 --> 00:16:15.070
We have to protect Toa!

00:16:23.716 --> 00:16:25.308
Gio!

00:16:33.659 --> 00:16:36.321
We've lost control of Agathion B!

00:16:40.199 --> 00:16:42.868
Gio took out that Agathion with one blow!

00:16:42.868 --> 00:16:45.671
Is that Tachibana Kazuki aboard him?

00:16:45.671 --> 00:16:49.441
No, it's... Kamishina Jin!

00:16:49.441 --> 00:16:51.568
Kamishina Jin?

00:16:53.212 --> 00:16:54.839
Him again?

00:16:56.348 --> 00:16:58.183
Kamishina Jin...

00:16:58.183 --> 00:17:01.380
Gio! We have to pull
that thing off the shuttle!

00:17:27.446 --> 00:17:32.117
The Agathions have been defeated.
They've been wiped out.

00:17:32.117 --> 00:17:34.887
All forces, retreat!

00:17:34.887 --> 00:17:38.157
The Girouard Force has begun retreating!

00:17:38.157 --> 00:17:41.126
- They did it!
- Thank goodness!

00:17:43.963 --> 00:17:46.632
It looks like we managed to pull through.

00:17:46.632 --> 00:17:51.303
With your help. I will
thank you some other time.

00:17:51.303 --> 00:17:53.305
I look forward to it.

00:17:53.305 --> 00:17:55.569
Well, if you will excuse me...

00:18:02.781 --> 00:18:05.484
O-Oh, no! As a result of the battle,

00:18:05.484 --> 00:18:08.354
the shuttle's reentry angle
is beginning to stray!

00:18:08.354 --> 00:18:10.322
Can't you correct it?

00:18:10.322 --> 00:18:13.926
No, we can't! Attitude
control is non-operational!

00:18:13.926 --> 00:18:17.262
- Oh, no!
- Captain Raina! Captain Raina!

00:18:17.262 --> 00:18:19.598
The shuttle is off-course!

00:18:19.598 --> 00:18:22.434
Can you back them up on your end?

00:18:22.434 --> 00:18:24.269
It doesn't look like we
can catch up to them.

00:18:24.269 --> 00:18:27.139
Damn, isn't there anything we can do?

00:18:27.139 --> 00:18:28.607
Unless we do something,

00:18:28.607 --> 00:18:31.474
the shuttle will burn up from the friction
when it enters the atmosphere!

00:18:37.282 --> 00:18:40.619
The shuttle is entering
the upper atmosphere!

00:18:40.619 --> 00:18:44.020
Fuselage surface temperature is
about to reach its critical level!

00:18:45.824 --> 00:18:47.793
Is that... Gio?!

00:18:47.793 --> 00:18:50.523
Gio, go even faster!

00:18:56.568 --> 00:18:58.670
What do they think they're doing?!

00:18:58.670 --> 00:19:00.172
It can't be!

00:19:00.172 --> 00:19:02.572
They're not thinking of acting as
a shield for the shuttle, are they?!

00:19:05.244 --> 00:19:08.247
The shuttle is entering
a thermal plasma state!

00:19:08.247 --> 00:19:11.011
Two minutes until we reacquire image!

00:19:19.391 --> 00:19:22.155
Hang in there! Hang in there, Gio!

00:19:33.872 --> 00:19:37.276
Hold out, Gio! We...

00:19:37.276 --> 00:19:41.213
...you... and I...

00:19:41.213 --> 00:19:43.511
...have to protect Toa!

00:20:09.141 --> 00:20:11.710
Amazing!

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:14.304
Who'd have ever thought of doing that?

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:33.957
Reacquiring image!

00:20:36.235 --> 00:20:39.905
It's safe! The shuttle is safe!

00:20:39.905 --> 00:20:42.305
They made it!

00:20:52.985 --> 00:20:57.445
Jin! You've done it again!

00:21:05.631 --> 00:21:08.767
Welcome to ISDA.

00:21:08.767 --> 00:21:13.672
Album, there are a number of
things that we must ask you,

00:21:13.672 --> 00:21:15.833
but first, let me have you look at this.

00:21:27.686 --> 00:21:30.621
It's one of your kind!

00:21:40.232 --> 00:21:44.336
Let me out! Let me out of here!

00:21:44.336 --> 00:21:47.134
Let me... let me see Toa!

00:21:48.974 --> 00:21:55.004
Toa! Let me see Toa...

00:22:07.559 --> 00:22:14.233
The moment our eyes met,

00:22:14.233 --> 00:22:21.039
I felt like the sadness was beginning

00:22:21.039 --> 00:22:27.713
The memories that can't be blotted out

00:22:27.713 --> 00:22:34.915
bind our hearts together, even now

00:22:36.755 --> 00:22:43.595
Though there are as many people

00:22:43.595 --> 00:22:46.598
as there are in these thousands of stars,

00:22:46.598 --> 00:22:50.469
you're the only one that I can see

00:22:50.469 --> 00:22:53.639
Though we may not be able to meet,

00:22:53.639 --> 00:22:56.575
and our wishes might not be granted,

00:22:56.575 --> 00:23:02.881
our growing feelings
are sure to last forever

00:23:02.881 --> 00:23:09.888
If fate tears the two of us apart,

00:23:09.888 --> 00:23:16.728
I believe that just meeting
each other was a miracle

00:23:16.728 --> 00:23:23.302
Look how it flows, like this rain

00:23:23.302 --> 00:23:29.341
I want to let all of my affection fall on you

00:23:29.341 --> 00:23:33.573
Rain of Love

00:23:43.188 --> 00:23:45.090
- Saki here.
- Ryoko here.

00:23:45.090 --> 00:23:48.960
ISDA Operator Megumi here...

00:23:48.960 --> 00:23:51.530
She's talking in her sleep. How sneaky.

00:23:51.530 --> 00:23:54.032
- Sometimes, she sleeps while she's at work.
- You mean, she takes naps?

00:23:54.032 --> 00:23:57.035
No, I mean, she's asleep,
but she's still working. It's scary.

00:23:57.035 --> 00:23:58.670
She could be gifted, in a certain sense.

00:23:58.670 --> 00:24:00.639
It's okay, sometimes
Commander Sakaki sleeps, too.

00:24:00.639 --> 00:24:01.440
- You're kidding!
- I'm kidding.

00:24:01.440 --> 00:24:03.108
Oof! Ow!

00:24:03.108 --> 00:24:06.311
Next time, lots of people
go different places...

00:24:06.311 --> 00:24:08.836
Amazing, she's doing
the preview while sleeping.
